# SkillFlow frozen routing override (family-slug -> winning template file)
# 依据 experiments/SkillFlow_campaign_scoreboard.md + SKILL_MEMORY_SUMMARY.md 的"定版"记录,
# 用真实旧跑批 config→分数 台账核实的每族最佳版本(in-sample,非泛化)。
# 仅列需要覆盖默认(sf-<slug>.j2)的族;未列出的族走默认。
# 格式:<family-slug> <template-filename>   (# 开头为注释)
#
# family-slug            template                              证据(job=最佳分)
embedded-data-repair      sf-embedded-data-repair-GK.j2        # sk-embedded-GK-s2 = 8/8 (canonical=4/8)
weighted-risk-assessment  sf-weighted.j2                       # sk-v5-weighted    = 7/8 (canonical=0/8)
healthcare-cost-benefit-analysis  sf-universal-v2.j2           # v2门 ~6/9 (7,6,4)  (canonical=1/9)
distribution-center-auditing      sf-universal-v2.j2           # v2门  5/8 (5,5,5)   (canonical=3/8)
inventory-finance-integration     sf-universal-v2.j2           # v2门  4/8 (4,4,3)   (canonical=0/8)
industry-correlation-analysis     sf-universal-v2.j2           # v2门  7/8 (7,7)     (canonical=6/8)
